Ghostty termio: stop reusing in-flight pty write buffers after pool growth

Backport of ghostty-org/ghostty PR #13659 (commit f948d420, 2026-08-06),
Exec.zig part only, onto the nitecon submodule (86d20c5d1).
Symptom: input longer than ~32 characters lost characters before reaching
the shell (discussion ghostty-org/ghostty#13655). Applied by
scripts/setup-linux.sh before `zig build`; drop it once the submodule
contains f948d420.

